From 9393db112bb16c91ccbe42ff68a1d23d21c74265 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:22:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] camera: colour IMX585 3840-wide crops fall back to the
 automatic sensor configuration again

Why: The configure loop tries an explicit sensorConfig first and an
automatic one only when allowAutoSensorConfigFallback is true. In the port
that was mono, IMX294 and IMX577 only. 1.6.0 also lets the IMX585 3840-wide
raw12 crops fall back to the automatic configuration
(CameraController.cpp:5993-5996@upstream-1.6.0), so a driver that has no
explicit mode for a crop still gives a picture and Core crops in software.
Without it, a 3840-wide crop the installed driver lacks (for example a
saved 3840x2076 on the cinemate-port driver with the probe off, or a crop
the original driver does not list) has no configuration at all.

What: allowAutoSensorConfigFallback also holds for the IMX585 when the
sanitised size is 3840 wide and isImx585LegacyCropResolution knows it.
That is 1.6.0's clause on the existing helper, with no second size list;
the helper also has 3840x2072, which 1.6.0's list lacked. The automatic
result passes the IMX477/577 size rule added in the previous commit (same
raw width, height at least the requested height), so a driver that hands
back a smaller stream is still refused. Mono is unchanged.

Tested: check_core.sh both builds (libcamera and without) and the host
tests pass. Not run on a sensor. Needs the camera, journal command:
journalctl -u apertar-core -b | grep -E 'camera configured|adjusted to too-small|rejected by'
Port driver (cd548ef), APERTAR_SENSOR_PROBE=0 in the unit environment:
set_resolution 3840x1744 configures explicitly as before; a hand-edited
resolution_height=2076 in camera_settings.conf shows the explicit try
rejected, then either an auto configure with raw 3840x2160 or the
"adjusted to too-small stream 3840x2072" refusal, never a configured raw
3840x2072. Original driver (e5b74d3): set_resolution 3840x1744 configures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NEFc1w7Y8dcyiV489BiwMr
---
 src/camera/CameraController.cpp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/camera/CameraController.cpp b/src/camera/CameraController.cpp
index 701b9c2..fb96e08 100644
--- a/src/camera/CameraController.cpp
+++ b/src/camera/CameraController.cpp
@@ -8307,7 +8307,10 @@ private:
             ? std::array<bool, 2>{ false, true }
             : std::array<bool, 2>{ true, false };
         const bool allowAutoSensorConfigFallback = monochromeSensor_ || sensorFamily_ == SensorFamily::Imx294 ||
-                                                   sensorFamily_ == SensorFamily::Imx577;
+                                                   sensorFamily_ == SensorFamily::Imx577 ||
+                                                   (sensorFamily_ == SensorFamily::Imx585 &&
+                                                    sanitized.resolution.width == 3840 &&
+                                                    isImx585LegacyCropResolution(sanitized.resolution));
         std::ostringstream rejectionLog;
 
         for (const SensorModeSelection &sensorMode : sensorModes) {
